msgstr "Pohranjena"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d BMCs"
msgstr "%d BMC jedinica"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "New Redfish Credential"
msgstr "Nova Redfish vjerodajnica"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Redfish Credential: %s"
msgstr "Redfish vjerodajnica: %s"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A BMC account with the ReadOnly role. The plugin never needs a role that can change BMC state."
msgstr "BMC račun s ulogom ReadOnly. Priključak nikada ne zahtijeva ulogu koja može mijenjati stanje BMC-a."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A password is stored. Leave blank to keep it."
msgstr "Zaporka je već pohranjena. Ostavite polje praznim da biste je zadržali."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "Stored encrypted with the vault key."
msgstr "Pohranjeno šifrirano ključem trezora."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed completely. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Redfish predlošci nisu u cijelosti instalirani. Ponovno ih instalirajte sa stranice Redfish BMC jedinice."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, polled by poller %d, with availability checks off. Its host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Uređaj \"%s\" iz predloška uređaja %s, koji obrađuje ispitivač %d, s isključenim provjerama dostupnosti. Njegov naziv poslužitelja rezerviran je naziv na koji se nikada ne šalju upiti."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query \"%s\", with a graph for each of the %d members known now."
msgstr "Upit podataka \"%s\", s grafikonom za svakog od %d trenutačno poznatih članova."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d fans or power supplies that were present are no longer reported. They count as failed until you confirm; confirming accepts the members the BMC reports now."
msgstr "%d ventilatora ili napajanja koja su ranije bila prisutna više se ne prijavljuju. Smatraju se neispravnima dok ne potvrdite; potvrdom se prihvaćaju članovi koje BMC trenutačno prijavljuje."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The graph \"%s\", with its \"%s\" data source."
msgstr "Grafikon \"%s\" s njegovim izvorom podataka \"%s\"."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "BMC je već pridružen uređaju."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Redfish plugin for BMC %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Stvorio priključak Redfish za BMC %s. Vrijednosti potječu iz predmemorije priključka; naziv poslužitelja rezerviran je naziv koji se nikada ne kontaktira."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "Cacti refused to create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti je odbio stvoriti uređaj. Provjerite Cacti dnevnik."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The new device would be hidden from you by your device permissions, so it was removed again. Ask an administrator to grant access, or map the BMC to a device you can see."
msgstr "Novi uređaj bio bi vam skriven zbog vaših ovlasti za uređaje pa je uklonjen. Zatražite od administratora dodjelu pristupa ili pridružite BMC uređaju koji možete vidjeti."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC was mapped to a device by someone else meanwhile, or could not be mapped, so the new device was removed again. Reload the page and check its mapping."
msgstr "U međuvremenu je netko drugi pridružio BMC uređaju ili pridruživanje nije uspjelo pa je novi uređaj uklonjen. Ponovno učitajte stranicu i provjerite pridruživanje."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed: %s"
msgstr "Redfish predloške nije bilo moguće instalirati: %s"

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed or not current. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Redfish predlošci nisu instalirani ili nisu ažurni. Ponovno ih instalirajte sa stranice Redfish BMC jedinice."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its Cacti device was deleted. Map it to another device or create one from the BMCs page."
msgstr "%s: njegov Cacti uređaj izbrisan je. Pridružite ga drugom uređaju ili stvorite novi sa stranice BMC jedinica."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its device is polled by poller %d but the BMC is read by poller %d. Move one of them so both use the same poller, or its graphs can read as unknown."
msgstr "%s: njegov uređaj ispituje ispitivač %d, dok BMC čita ispitivač %d. Premjestite jedan od njih kako bi oba koristila isti ispitivač, inače grafikoni mogu očitavati nepoznate vrijednosti."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "Redfish graphs of this device"
msgstr "Redfish grafikoni ovog uređaja"

